{"id":"435007","name":"香菇鸡腿汤","author":"小丫superstar","authorId":"11251129","desc":"","cover":"images/435007/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡腿","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"花椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡腿剁块，香菇切丁。","img":"images/435007/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅内凉水放入鸡腿。","img":"images/435007/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加几片姜片、花椒淖水。","img":"images/435007/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"水滚后撇去浮沫，鸡腿捞出用开水冲洗干净。","img":"images/435007/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把鸡腿、香菇分别放入4个炖盅，倒入开水，每个炖盅内放3片姜片。","img":"images/435007/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炖盅放入炖锅，炖4个小时。","img":"images/435007/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取出炖盅。","img":"images/435007/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盛碗，加入适量盐。","img":"images/435007/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"没有加太多作料，保持了鸡汤的原味。\n \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电子瓦煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}